        "answer": {
          "short": "$4e^{2x}+C$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\int\\frac{8}{e^{-2x}}\\,dx&=8\\int e^{2x}\\,dx\\\\&=8\\left(\\frac{e^{2x}}{2}\\right)+C\\\\&=4e^{2x}+C\\end{align*}$$",
